{"id":"3a955b3d4b1ba224","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-listing.md","title":"c.e. 集合的全函数值域表征","display":"thm-listing — c.e. 集合的全函数值域表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-listing","aliases":["20-thm-listing"],"display":"thm-listing — c.e. 集合的全函数值域表征","chapter":"2","section":"2.1.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.1.10；Exercise 2.1.24(i) 的统一条款","source_pdf_pages":[62,64],"source_printed_pages":[26,28],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-listing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-listing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-listing — c.e. 集合的全函数值域表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.1.10；Exercise 2.1.24(i) 的统一条款"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62</span><span>64</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span><span>28</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为全可计算一元函数族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 为固定有限阶段枚举。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}listing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\Longleftrightarrow\n(A=\\varnothing\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ A=\\operatorname{ran}(f)),\\\\\n\\exists q:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ [q\\text{ 全可计算}\\land\\forall e\\\n(W_e\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi_{q(e)}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_{q(e)})=W_e)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}listing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\Longleftrightarrow\n(A=\\varnothing\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ A=\\operatorname{ran}(f)),\\\\\n\\exists q:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ [q\\text{ 全可计算}\\land\\forall e\\\n(W_e\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi_{q(e)}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_{q(e)})=W_e)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(e)\">\\(q(e)\\)</span> 的程序在任意输入上先寻找 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 的首个非空阶段，取该有限集的最小成员 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_e\">\\(a_e\\)</span>。把输入解码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle s,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle s,x\\rangle\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_{e,s}\">\\(x\\in W_{e,s}\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，否则输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_e\">\\(a_e\\)</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 非空，第一步必停，后续为有限判定，因此是全函数；输出均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_e\">\\(x\\in W_e\\)</span> 在某阶段的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle s,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle s,x\\rangle\\)</span> 被输出，故值域恰等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>。程序统一于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，s-m-n 给全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=\\varnothing\">\\(W_e=\\varnothing\\)</span>，该输出程序可处处不停止；编译器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 仍全可计算。这里恢复原书的带承诺统一性，避免把“输出全函数的索引”误解成必须对空集也产生全枚举。反向给一个全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，枚举所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)\">\\(f(n)\\)</span> 即枚举其值域；也可对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 交错寻找 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)=x\">\\(f(n)=x\\)</span>，得到以该值域为域的程序。空集独立由恒发散程序枚举。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 26、28 / PDF 62、64。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}listing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\Longleftrightarrow\n(A=\\varnothing\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ A=\\operatorname{ran}(f)),\\\\\n\\exists q:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ [q\\text{ 全可计算}\\land\\forall e\\\n(W_e\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi_{q(e)}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_{q(e)})=W_e)].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"q(e)","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"a_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle s,x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"a_e","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle s,x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"W_e=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"f(n)=x","display":false}],"bytes":2231,"backlinks":[{"id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-thm-listing]]。"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","e343870c773cb68e","35073b74f84433b3","4ef1aee16db6b308","8ba6597a854c206f"]}